  "id": 508545975,
  "name": "发送手机号短信验证码",
  "type": "http",
  "serverId": "",
  "preProcessors": [],
  "postProcessors": [],
  "inheritPreProcessors": {},
  "inheritPostProcessors": {},
  "description": "## 功能说明\n\n发送手机号短信验证码接口：重新发送注册短信验证码（**仅对已提交注册意向、尚未完成校验**的手机号生效）。\n\n- 复用注册意向中的用户名 / 密码 / 批次，生成新验证码并下发\n- 未找到注册意向 → 20003「未找到注册意向，请先提交注册」\n- 60 秒冷却防刷（按验证方式 + 凭证全局生效）\n\n## 签名机制\n\n调用本接口必须携带签名公共参数（`app_id` / `timestamp` / `nonce` / `sign`），否则返回 20011。\n\n### 签名算法\n\n1. 取除 `sign` 外的**所有参数**（含 app_id / timestamp / nonce / 业务参数）\n2. 按键名 ASCII 升序排序\n3. 拼接为 `key=value&key=value...`\n4. 以 `app_secret` 为密钥做 HMAC-SHA256，输出小写 hex\n\n## 请求方式\n\n- 请求体：`application/x-www-form-urlencoded`（表单）\n- 不支持 GET 方法（返回 405）",
  "operationId": "",
  "sourceUrl": "",
  "method": "post",
  "path": "/api/user_center/users/verify/phone/send",
  "tags": [],
  "status": "released",
  "requestBody": {
    "type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
    "description": "重发验证码表单参数（含签名公共参数）",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "id": "phone#0",
        "name": "phone",
        "required": true,
        "description": "注册手机号（需已提交注册意向且未完成校验）",
        "example": "13800138000",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "id": "app_id#1",
        "name": "app_id",
        "required": true,
        "description": "接入项目 APPID（系统自动生成（app_ 前缀），创建后固定不可修改，公开标识）",
        "example": "app_5f3a9c2b7e6d8f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "id": "timestamp#2",
        "name": "timestamp",
        "required": true,
        "description": "10 位时间戳（秒），与服务器时间差须在 ±5 分钟内，防重放",
        "example": "1725000000",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "id": "nonce#3",
        "name": "nonce",
        "required": true,
        "description": "随机字符串，每次请求唯一",
        "example": "a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "id": "sign#4",
        "name": "sign",
        "required": true,
        "description": "HMAC-SHA256 签名（小写 hex），密钥为项目 app_secret",
        "example": "3f9a7c1e...（64 位小写 hex）",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
